{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014ELZRZA7CUzbrUiicWYDy4","type":"tool_result","content":"    2606 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml\n163:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode review --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n606:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n607:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n651:        extension_rule: \"When extension_pending == true, step_extend_completed_run has just set status initialized and appended run_extended, so a synthesis_complete row followed by an extended row is consistent: classify as resume, never as invalid-state or completed-session.\"\n728:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n730:            GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n731:            [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n939:      step_create_state_log:\n950:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n951:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n972:      step_create_strategy:\n1219:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1341:              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error; blockedStop when decision is STOP and reason is blockedStop; else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1353:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1553:        action: \"Rewrite raw pause and recovery events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached\"\n1787:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the review pass yourself, write the iteration file and the delta, and hand the iteration record to the append gateway (append-mode-event.cjs) exactly as the leaf contract requires, never writing the state log yourself, then continue to post_dispatch_validate.\"\n1911:              GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1912:              [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1936:            GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1937:            [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1952:            GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n1953:            [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2113:          - reason: \"Use the latest stop reason if present: read stopReason from the last line of {state_paths.state_log} with type === 'event' and event === 'terminal_gates' when it is newer than the latest stop event, since a manual stop is stored only there. On a fan-out root (direct lineage state logs exist and the root state log holds no such stop row): take each lineage that {state_paths.packet_dir}/orchestration-summary.json lists with status succeeded, and read the stopReason of the last row carrying a stopReason in {state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/<label>/deep-review-state.jsonl; when they agree use it, when they differ use the one whose row has the latest timestamp, since the run ended when that lineage stopped. Only when neither yields a reason, the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached.)\"\n2206:            GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2207:            [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2387:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2388:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2429:        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-21T21:53:17.953Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"    2606 .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review.yaml\n163:  command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode review --run-directory {artifact_dir} --event-json <record file>\"\n606:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n607:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n651:        extension_rule: \"When extension_pending == true, step_extend_completed_run has just set status initialized and appended run_extended, so a synthesis_complete row followed by an extended row is consistent: classify as resume, never as invalid-state or completed-session.\"\n728:          open_run: \"Run step_create_state_log.command unchanged. With the hand-written log set aside, it opens the run from the moved config.\"\n730:            GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n731:            [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n939:      step_create_state_log:\n950:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n951:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n972:      step_create_strategy:\n1219:          1. if iteration_count >= max_iterations: STOP (maxIterationsReached). This terminal cap is evaluated before every veto, the claim-adjudication veto included; failed legal-stop gates are recorded in stop_decision.blockedBy as synthesis evidence.\n1341:              terminal_stop_reason = reason when it is maxIterationsReached, maxDurationReached, manualStop or error; blockedStop when decision is STOP and reason is blockedStop; else \"converged\". Read reason, never stopReason: every manual stop sets reason to manualStop while stopReason may still hold blockedStop or stuckRecovery\n1353:              excluded_reasons: [maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached]\n1553:        action: \"Rewrite raw pause and recovery events to the frozen STOP_REASONS enum at emission time: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused, maxDurationReached\"\n1787:            - \"PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt 