"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2387:          GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2388:          [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2429:        note: \"Every earlier reducer pass ran before closeout wrote synthesis_complete and before the status flip, so the dashboard would keep its pre-completion status. A fan-out root keeps no root dashboard.\"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014ELZRZA7CUzbrUiicWYDy4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
